{"id":"en_midnight-bus","title":"Midnight Bus","titleEn":"Midnight Bus","description":"Night-shift bus driver Hannah has devoted a decade to a carefully concealed plan of vengeance, exploiting the rule against pregnant passengers as her pretext. She draws onto her bus the very people responsible for her sister's death, then stages a sequence of crises through illusion, pushing each of them to expose the selfishness beneath their surface. Once the police arrive, those who are guilty are brought to justice, and Hannah at last finds peace for her departed sister.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/midnight-bus/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/midnight-bus/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","Suspense","Underdog","Urban","Plot Twists","Eastern Fantasy"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cx4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_midnight-bus_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cx4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_midnight-bus_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cx4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_midnight-bus_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cx4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_midnight-bus_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cx4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_midnight-bus_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0",